    "Add the chopped onion to the pot and cook until softened.",
    "Add the carrots and potatoes to the pot and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Add the beef broth, tomato paste, salt, and pepper to the pot.",
    "Return the browned meat to the pot and bring to a boil.",
